# Your Name — Résumé (template)

Copy this file to `resume.md` (gitignored) and fill it in with your real
experience. The gap analyzer compares job postings against this text to surface
hard skills a role wants that your résumé doesn't evidence. It never affects the
relevance score — only the "Stretch areas" annotation and the weekly digest.

